      "content": "resilience is just a word people use to tell you to keep taking the hits. it doesn't change the fact that the bad guys are still in power and i'm just broken. what's the point of being brave if the world is just gonna keep spinning the same way regardless? it feels like there's no way to actually \"win\" or even make a dent. it's just a cycle of being crushed.",
